A computed expression in a mapping, which slice 1 of the lens language does
not support.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	a: int
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	a: int
	b: int
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		b: v0_0.a + 1
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0333]: b: a mapping is a reference to v0_0, a constant, a nested body, drop, orelse, remap or each; other expressions are not supported yet
 --> 1.0.thema:9:6
  |
9 |         b: v0_0.a + 1
  |            ^^^^
  |
